{"files":[{"content":"/*\n  Quicksort\n*/\n#include <stdio.h>\n#include <stdlib.h>\n#include <limits.h>\n#include <openssl/md5.h>\n\n#define INSERTION_SORT_CUTOFF 24\n#define PARALLEL_SORT_LIMIT 65536\n#define TASK_SORT_LIMIT 16384\n\nvoid srandnum(int seed);\ndouble randnum(void);\nint *generate_case(int N);\ndouble drand(int xmin, int xmax);\nvoid swap(int *toorder, int i, int j);\nvoid _quicksort(int *toorder, int lo, int hi);\nvoid quicksort(int *toorder, int N);\nint is_sorted(int *toorder, int N);\n\nstatic int sort_depth_limit(int length);\nstatic void insertion_sort(int *toorder, int lo, int hi);\nstatic int median_of_three(const int *toorder, int lo, int hi);\nstatic void partition_three_way(int *toorder, int lo, int hi, int pivot,\n                                int *equal_lo, int *equal_hi);\nstatic void sift_down(int *toorder, int base, int root, int count);\nstatic void heapsort_range(int *toorder, int lo, int hi);\nstatic void introsort_serial(int *toorder, int lo, int hi, int depth_limit);\n#ifdef _OPENMP\nstatic void introsort_parallel(int *toorder, int lo, int hi, int depth_limit);\n#endif\n\n#define MY_RAND_MAX 0x7FFFFFFF\n#define RANDNUM_W 521288629\n#define RANDNUM_Z 362436069\n\nunsigned int randum_w = RANDNUM_W;\nunsigned int randum_z = RANDNUM_Z;\n\nvoid srandnum(int seed)\n{\n    unsigned int w, z;\n    w = (seed * 104623) & 0xffffffff;\n    randum_w = (w) ? w : RANDNUM_W;\n    z = (seed * 48947) & 0xffffffff;\n    randum_z = (z) ? z : RANDNUM_Z;\n}\n\ndouble randnum(void)\n{\n    unsigned int u;\n    randum_z = 36969 * (randum_z & 65535) + (randum_z >> 16);\n    randum_w = 18000 * (randum_w & 65535) + (randum_w >> 16);\n    u = (randum_z << 16) + randum_w;\n    return (abs(u));\n}\n\nint main(int argc, char *argv[])\n{\n    int N = 0;\n    int *our_list = NULL;\n\n    scanf(\"%d\", &N);\n    if (N <= 0) {\n        printf(\"Error: please, provide the case size.\\n\");\n        return 1;\n    }\n\n    our_list = generate_case(N);\n    if (our_list == NULL) {\n        printf(\"Error: case instantiation failed.\\n\");\n        return 1;\n    }\n\n    quicksort(our_list, N);\n\n    if (is_sorted(our_list, N) == 1) {\n        printf(\"Error, for some reason list is still unsorted.\\n\");\n        return 1;\n    }\n\n#ifdef COMPUTE_MD5_PROBLEM\n    MD5_CTX c;\n    unsigned char out[MD5_DIGEST_LENGTH];\n    MD5_Init(&c);\n    MD5_Update(&c, our_list, N * sizeof(int));\n    MD5_Final(out, &c);\n    for (int n = 0; n < MD5_DIGEST_LENGTH; n++) {\n        printf(\"%02x\", out[n]);\n    }\n#endif\n    printf(\"\\n\");\n\n    free(our_list);\n    return 0;\n}\n\nvoid quicksort(int *toorder, int N)\n{\n    if (N <= 1)\n        return;\n\n#ifdef _OPENMP\n    if (N >= PARALLEL_SORT_LIMIT) {\n        int depth_limit = sort_depth_limit(N);\n#pragma omp parallel\n        {\n#pragma omp single\n            introsort_parallel(toorder, 0, N - 1, depth_limit);\n        }\n        return;\n    }\n#endif\n    _quicksort(toorder, 0, N - 1);\n}\n\nvoid _quicksort(int *toorder, int lo, int hi)\n{\n    if (lo < hi)\n        introsort_serial(toorder, lo, hi, sort_depth_limit(hi - lo + 1));\n}\n\nvoid swap(int *toorder, int i, int j)\n{\n    if (i == j)\n        return;\n    int temp = toorder[i];\n    toorder[i] = toorder[j];\n    toorder[j] = temp;\n}\n\nstatic int sort_depth_limit(int length)\n{\n    int depth = 0;\n    while (length > 1) {\n        length >>= 1;\n        depth += 2;\n    }\n    return depth;\n}\n\nstatic void insertion_sort(int *toorder, int lo, int hi)\n{\n    for (int i = lo + 1; i <= hi; i++) {\n        int value = toorder[i];\n        int j = i;\n        while (j > lo && toorder[j - 1] > value) {\n            toorder[j] = toorder[j - 1];\n            j--;\n        }\n        toorder[j] = value;\n    }\n}\n\nstatic int median_of_three(const int *toorder, int lo, int hi)\n{\n    int mid = lo + (hi - lo) / 2;\n    int a = toorder[lo];\n    int b = toorder[mid];\n    int c = toorder[hi];\n\n    if (a < b) {\n        if (b < c)\n            return b;\n        return (a < c) ? c : a;\n    }\n    if (a < c)\n        return a;\n    return (b < c) ? c : b;\n}\n\nstatic void partition_three_way(int *toorder, int lo, int hi, int pivot,\n                                int *equal_lo, int *equal_hi)\n{\n    int lt = lo;\n    int i = lo;\n    int gt = hi;\n\n    while (i <= gt) {\n        if (toorder[i] < pivot) {\n            swap(toorder, lt, i);\n            lt++;\n            i++;\n        } else if (toorder[i] > pivot) {\n            swap(toorder, i, gt);\n            gt--;\n        } else {\n            i++;\n        }\n    }\n    *equal_lo = lt;\n    *equal_hi = gt;\n}\n\nstatic void sift_down(int *toorder, int base, int root, int count)\n{\n    while (root < count / 2) {\n        int child = root * 2 + 1;\n        if (child + 1 < count &&\n            toorder[base + child] < toorder[base + child + 1])\n            child++;\n        if (toorder[base + root] >= toorder[base + child])\n            return;\n        swap(toorder, base + root, base + child);\n        root = child;\n    }\n}\n\nstatic void heapsort_range(int *toorder, int lo, int hi)\n{\n    int count = hi - lo + 1;\n    for (int start = count / 2; start > 0; start--)\n        sift_down(toorder, lo, start - 1, count);\n    for (int end = count; end > 1; end--) {\n        swap(toorder, lo, lo + end - 1);\n        sift_down(toorder, lo, 0, end - 1);\n    }\n}\n\nstatic void introsort_serial(int *toorder, int lo, int hi, int depth_limit)\n{\n    while (lo < hi) {\n        int length = hi - lo + 1;\n        if (length <= INSERTION_SORT_CUTOFF) {\n            insertion_sort(toorder, lo, hi);\n            return;\n        }\n        if (depth_limit <= 0) {\n            heapsort_range(toorder, lo, hi);\n            return;\n        }\n\n        depth_limit--;\n        int equal_lo, equal_hi;\n        int pivot = median_of_three(toorder, lo, hi);\n        partition_three_way(toorder, lo, hi, pivot, &equal_lo, &equal_hi);\n        int left_size = equal_lo - lo;\n        int right_size = hi - equal_hi;\n\n        if (left_size < right_size) {\n            introsort_serial(toorder, lo, equal_lo - 1, depth_limit);\n            lo = equal_hi + 1;\n        } else {\n            introsort_serial(toorder, equal_hi + 1, hi, depth_limit);\n            hi = equal_lo - 1;\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n#ifdef _OPENMP\nstatic void introsort_parallel(int *toorder, int lo, int hi, int depth_limit)\n{\n    while (lo < hi) {\n        int length = hi - lo + 1;\n        if (length < TASK_SORT_LIMIT || depth_limit <= 1) {\n            introsort_serial(toorder, lo, hi, depth_limit);\n            return;\n        }\n\n        int equal_lo, equal_hi;\n        int pivot = median_of_three(toorder, lo, hi);\n        partition_three_way(toorder, lo, hi, pivot, &equal_lo, &equal_hi);\n        int left_size = equal_lo - lo;\n        int right_size = hi - equal_hi;\n        int next_depth = depth_limit - 1;\n\n        if (left_size < right_size) {\n            if (left_size >= TASK_SORT_LIMIT) {\n                int task_lo = lo;\n                int task_hi = equal_lo - 1;\n                int task_depth = next_depth;\n#pragma omp task default(none) firstprivate(toorder, task_lo, task_hi, task_depth)\n                introsort_parallel(toorder, task_lo, task_hi, task_depth);\n            } else if (left_size > 1) {\n                introsort_serial(toorder, lo, equal_lo - 1, next_depth);\n            }\n            lo = equal_hi + 1;\n        } else {\n            if (right_size >= TASK_SORT_LIMIT) {\n                int task_lo = equal_hi + 1;\n                int task_hi = hi;\n                int task_depth = next_depth;\n#pragma omp task default(none) firstprivate(toorder, task_lo, task_hi, task_depth)\n                introsort_parallel(toorder, task_lo, task_hi, task_depth);\n            } else if (right_size > 1) {\n                introsort_serial(toorder, equal_hi + 1, hi, next_depth);\n            }\n            hi = equal_lo - 1;\n        }\n        depth_limit = next_depth;\n    }\n}\n#endif\n\nint is_sorted(int *toorder, int N)\n{\n    int has_inversion = 0;\n    for (int i = 1; i < N; i++)\n        has_inversion |= (toorder[i] < toorder[i - 1]);\n    return has_inversion;\n}\n\nint *generate_case(int N)\n{\n    int i;\n    int *ret = NULL;\n\n    srandnum(0);\n    ret = (int *) malloc(N * sizeof(int));\n    if (ret == NULL) {\n        printf(\"Error: some malloc won't work.\\n\");\n        return NULL;\n    }\n    for (i = 0; i < N; i++) {\n        ret[i] = drand(0, INT_MAX);\n    }\n    return ret;\n}\n\ndouble drand(int xmin, int xmax)\n{\n    return xmin + (xmax - xmin) * randnum() / MY_RAND_MAX;\n}\n","path":"src/quicksort.c"}],"hypothesis":"Combining the previously successful three-way introsort with the archived 65,536-element OpenMP entry point and 16,384-element task grain may expose parallel work on medium-sized arrays while preserving the generated sequence and checksum. Self-swap elision and the inversion reduction are retained as bounded supporting changes.","notes":"The earlier 0.02858-second result used different OpenMP thresholds; it does not establish the speed of this retuned candidate. Correctness and timing are left to the controller.","research":{"queries":[],"urls":[]},"sources_kept":["45664f94e8d640e8","213dc4953f734eab","31711b2db43f40cd","1f46b87724654d98","e78f66bf5b4e47c4","b01ab790b5c643af","20e94c8db7ab4472"],"transformations":["Keep case generation and the PRNG sequence unchanged; replace sort-time random-pivot Lomuto partitioning with median-of-three three-way introsort, insertion sort for ranges up to 24, and heapsort at the depth limit.","Use the archived OpenMP entry threshold of 65,536 elements and task grain of 16,384 elements; tasks operate on disjoint partitions and smaller work is sorted serially.","Recurse on the smaller serial partition while iterating over the larger, and elide self-swaps.","Replace the early-exit sortedness check with an OR reduction over adjacent inversion comparisons."]}